{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134300/extras/57b9679a94b3009c3c3614946c9be505.avif?t=1770306460\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cleaning.INC</strong> is a cozy, casual, and easy-going cleaning game where you take on the role of manager of a <strong>newly established cleaning company</strong> in town!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As you take on jobs around the neighborhood, discover a <strong>vibrant and charming city</strong>, where life isn\u2019t always easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134300/extras/44164dea1f0d8883f45cfc53fdea95e2.avif?t=1770306460\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the residents and help them with their misadventures through <strong>25</strong> varied and colorful levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, sort\u2026 and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>stickers</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>all in-game achievements</strong> (non-Steam)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy items from the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with <strong>over 120 objects !</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple gameplay</strong>, playable with a single click</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for playing while doing something else</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun, cozy, and colorful</strong> atmosphere</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute 2D graphics</strong>, fully hand-drawn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>\ud83d\udd27 Updates &amp; support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updates are planned to improve the experience and fix potential bugs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A soft and delightfully offbeat break, perfect for relaxing while bringing a little more cleanliness back into the world.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134300/extras/86744eded124ce6dba73256d09dde401.avif?t=1770306460\" width=1024 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4134300?t=1770306460","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4134300?t=1770306460","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134300/aaad21b1cc1a8786ac79d197c0177ce0a25fb0fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770306460","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134300/aaad21b1cc1a8786ac79d197c0177ce0a25fb0fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770306460","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134300/extras/57b9679a94b3009c3c3614946c9be505.avif?t=1770306460\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cleaning.INC</strong> is a cozy, casual, and easy-going cleaning gam